From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:09:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] droidcamsrc: stop the preview outside the device lock

A HAL can finish a picture that is still being taken before its
stopPreview() returns: the Exynos HAL1 HAL of the SM-T520 joins its
picture thread there. That thread's shutter and JPEG callbacks take
dev->lock, which dev_stop() held across
droid_media_camera_stop_preview(), so closing the camera with a
picture pending hung.

Mark the device as not running under the lock, then call
stop_preview without it, as dev_close() already does for the
disconnect. Callbacks that arrive in the meantime see
dev->running == FALSE.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcdev.c | 14 +++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcdev.c b/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcdev.c
index c227853..02756dd 100644
--- a/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcdev.c
+++ b/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcdev.c
@@ -858,6 +858,8 @@ out:
 void
 gst_droidcamsrc_dev_stop (GstDroidCamSrcDev * dev)
 {
+  DroidMediaCamera *cam = NULL;
+
   g_rec_mutex_lock (dev->lock);
 
   GST_DEBUG ("dev stop");
@@ -867,8 +869,18 @@ gst_droidcamsrc_dev_stop (GstDroidCamSrcDev * dev)
     if (dev->pool) {
       gst_buffer_pool_set_active (dev->pool, FALSE);
     }
-    droid_media_camera_stop_preview (dev->cam);
+    cam = dev->cam;
     dev->running = FALSE;
+  }
+
+  /* Not under dev->lock: a HAL can finish a picture that is still being
+   * taken before its stopPreview() returns (the Exynos HAL1 HAL waits for
+   * its picture thread there), and the shutter and JPEG callbacks of that
+   * picture take dev->lock. dev->running is already FALSE for them. */
+  if (cam) {
+    g_rec_mutex_unlock (dev->lock);
+    droid_media_camera_stop_preview (cam);
+    g_rec_mutex_lock (dev->lock);
     GST_DEBUG ("stopped preview");
   }
 
